&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Manager of the EMEA Digital Natives Applied AI Architecture team, you&#39;ll drive adoption of frontier AI across Europe&#39;s fastest-growing technology companies: SaaS scale-ups, fintechs, marketplaces, consumer platforms, and developer-tooling businesses. Your team makes Anthropic&#39;s products (Claude Enterprise, Claude Code, and the Claude API) successful in production. They address each customer&#39;s business needs and technical requirements, and they meet the high bar for reliability and safety that these companies&#39; own users expect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead and grow a team of Applied AI Architects across EMEA. You&#39;ll set the pre-sales standards for the segment, develop each person on the team, and act as a technical lead on some of Anthropic&#39;s most strategic European accounts. You&#39;ll work closely with Sales, Product, and Engineering to help digital-native companies build Claude into their core products and platforms. You&#39;ll also explain complex solutions clearly to both engineers and executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage and mentor a distributed team of Applied AI Architects, providing technical guidance and career development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set goals and run performance reviews that drive growth and output&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work directly with a small number of the highest-value EMEA digital-native customers on their AI adoption strategy, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;use case scoping&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;building technical champions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;running POCs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with EMEA GTM leadership to understand customer requirements and co-build segment strategy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the technical side of pre-sales, making sure your team delivers compelling demos and validates customer ROI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guide customers through EMEA-specific technical and procurement requirements, including GDPR, the EU AI Act, and data residency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Align cross-functional stakeholders across time zones and regions to drive business outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel regularly across EMEA for executive sessions, technical workshops, and relationship building&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the vision and execution of solutions that use our latest models for tech-forward use cases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent Anthropic in the European tech community through conferences, meetups, webinars, and technical content&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stay current on AI/ML developments and the competitive landscape in the European tech sector&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of experience as a Solutions Architect, Sales Engineer, or in a similar pre-sales technical role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3+ years of experience managing pre-sales or technical GTM teams, ideally across multiple EMEA markets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience selling to and working with digital-native companies, such as vertical or horizontal SaaS, consumer tech, fintech, PaaS, or developer platforms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
